==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s (100%) spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Snache]] (100%) spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Snache]] (100%) spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Those Guys]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Those Guys]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Snache]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very simple stage, use any [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to easily beat the stage.

